{"unit_id":"green-dalii__dsh-shift-router#card-1","repo":"green-dalii/dsh-shift-router","commit":"26493319f5d71d0da682b21a5a32a5ada2fb58a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shift-router 是 DSH Web 客户端的双层模型路由插件。它在每轮开始时由 LLM Judge 判断任务适合 Fast 还是 Smart 模型链，并通过请求钩子选择该轮模型；系统按预期成本路由，升级即时生效，降级要求连续明确的 Fast 判断。它还支持按顺序切换备用模型、失败冷却、缓存感知路由、手动指定档位、状态与成本统计，以及 Smart 任务的子代理编排和验收审计。用户可用命令或 GUI 表单调整模型链与策略，适合希望降低常规任务成本并为复杂任务保留强模型的 DSH 用户。需在 DSH 配置可用模型及服务凭证，模型请求经 DSH LLM 接口发出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-240","src/index.ts:605-620","src/index.ts:662-780","src/client/index.tsx:90-140"]}
{"unit_id":"green-dalii__dsh-shift-router#card-2","repo":"green-dalii/dsh-shift-router","commit":"26493319f5d71d0da682b21a5a32a5ada2fb58a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-shift-router routes each DSH turn to a Fast or Smart model chain using an LLM Judge and expected-cost rules. It offers fallback with cooldowns, manual routing, cost status, and optional subagent orchestration. Configure it by command or GUI; calls use DSH providers.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-240","src/index.ts:605-620","src/index.ts:662-780","src/client/index.tsx:90-140"]}
