{"unit_id":"green-dalii__dsh-shift-router#feature-1","repo":"green-dalii/dsh-shift-router","commit":"26493319f5d71d0da682b21a5a32a5ada2fb58a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shift-router 的功能「双档任务路由」：每轮由 LLM Judge 对任务作 Fast 或 Smart 判断，路由规则根据预期成本选择当前档位；不确定的判断会保持当前档位。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/router.ts:288-370"]}
